Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:01:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 22/24] sherlock-wrap-export: lfr_e3, the E3 all-entries L_Fr
 fixture with D-9 decode cases

Exports the L_Fr proof of the L verifier on the E3 all-entries proof
(seed 14) as wrapin v1 with 1,522 public words, plus the stock decode
verdicts on the honest words and 10 tampered word vectors.
